WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.325
Some Indian rivers flood while

2
00:00:02.325 --> 00:00:03.688
others run dry.

3
00:00:03.688 --> 00:00:05.554
Why not link them?

4
00:00:05.883 --> 00:00:08.468
The National Perspective Plan for

5
00:00:08.468 --> 00:00:10.967
linking rivers came in 1980.

6
00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:12.667
The first project,

7
00:00:12.667 --> 00:00:15.679
Ken–Betwa, was approved in December

8
00:00:15.679 --> 00:00:16.670
2021.

9
00:00:17.004 --> 00:00:18.702
The plan has a Himalayan

10
00:00:18.702 --> 00:00:21.672
component and a Peninsular one.

11
00:00:21.994 --> 00:00:24.484
Supporters cite irrigation and drought

12
00:00:24.484 --> 00:00:26.973
relief. Critics point to submerged

13
00:00:26.973 --> 00:00:28.554
forests, displacement,

14
00:00:28.554 --> 00:00:30.256
and river ecology.

15
00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:31.867
Your turn.

16
00:00:31.867 --> 00:00:33.803
Which is the first?
